Subject: [PATCH] feat(kanban): define strict containment policy wire contract
 [daveey]

Foundation only: no lifecycle transition or production integration yet. Preserve the four legacy route boundaries as controls. Primary Opus scope review requires board-global task identity, same-board predicates, home-authoritative release and a Board companion fence before synced activation. Proof: canonical focused suites and policy guard mutations; full lifecycle, CLI/tool and replica proofs remain on the implementation owner.
